# Prisma: db push (Rocha)

Global safety (`prisma-caution.mdc`) still applies. Here = repo ops.

When schema sync needed:

1. `npx prisma generate`
2. Additive/safe → `npx prisma db push` without asking. Lossy (`--accept-data-loss`) → confirm first
3. Restart: kill project `next dev`, then `npm run dev`

Do not only tell user to run push — execute safe pushes and report. Habitual flow = `db push` (not `migrate dev`) unless task asks migrations.

Local `.env` = Neon **development** only. Prod schema is separate — see `DEPLOY.md` (and `neon-prod-parity.mdc` when present).
